  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 501.01 Definitions of Terms Used in this Chapter. In this chapter, \"NAADA, The Association of Addiction Professionals (NAADAC)\" means a nationwide membership organization of addiction counselors, educators, and other addiction-focused health care professionals in the United States.\n\nSource. #9454, eff 4-11-09, EXPIRED: 4-11-17\n\nNew. #12548, eff 7-1-18; ss by #14586, eff 7-13-26, EXPIRES: 7-13-36",
